  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Thermal energy is given by<br />$\\mathrm{H}=\\mathrm{P} \\times \\mathrm{t}=\\frac{\\mathrm{V}^2}{\\mathrm{R}} \\times \\mathrm{t}$<br />Here, voltage $\\mathrm{V}$ is same.<br />$\\therefore \\quad \\frac{\\mathrm{H}_1}{\\mathrm{H}_2}=\\frac{\\frac{\\mathrm{V}^2 \\mathrm{t}}{\\mathrm{R}}}{\\frac{\\mathrm{V}^2 \\mathrm{t}}{3 \\mathrm{R}}}=3: 1$",
    "image": null
